  "scope": "Three sequential server-only gperftools diagnostics using one frozen client. Two retained clients and two waves of8192 temporary single-member rooms, with verified1KiB routing before/after each wave. Every raw heap row sums to its capture header. Whole requested live/cumulative heap; not ordinary RSS or timing. Initial prototype compacts sparse arenas but keeps their small allocations after the last client leaves. Selected remembers that compaction occurred and restores full empty-worker cleanup. Release unwind stacks merge unrelated raw-vector allocation sites; source and whole-heap ablation establish the mechanism without claiming exact allocation-site attribution.",
